<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2019336897"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1667201383"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ぜんぶ嫌いだ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="こはならむ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ぜんぶ嫌いだ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:08.117"><div begin="00:00.865" end="03:55.732"><p begin="00:00.865" end="00:06.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">どうしていつも素直に自分の気持ちとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么总是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u shi te i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="00:06.210" end="00:10.292" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">言えないの 言えないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耿直坦率地说出口呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i e na i no i e na i yo</span></p><p begin="00:22.458" end="00:25.324" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">怖かったんだ嫌われるのが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">害怕遭受他人厌恶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa ka 't ta n da ki ra wa re ru no ga</span></p><p begin="00:25.324" end="00:28.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">言葉が何をしでかすのか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">担心祸从口出 横生事端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ga na ni wo shi de ka su no ka</span></p><p begin="00:28.146" end="00:30.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">口を噤んで空気を呑んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是缄口不言 忍气吞声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku chi wo tsu gu n de ku u ki wo no n de</span></p><p begin="00:30.844" end="00:33.462" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">心に蓋を落とした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加盖封闭心灵 紧闭心门</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ni fu ta wo o to shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:33.659" end="00:36.474" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">あの時なんて言えば良かった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当时如果能说出口就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no to ki na n te i e ba yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:36.474" end="00:39.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">君の顔が見れなかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却不敢直视你的面庞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ka o ga mi re na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:39.202" end="00:42.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">傷つけたかも そう思うほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心里越是害怕会受到伤害</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu ke ta ka mo so u o mo u ho do</span></p><p begin="00:42.043" end="00:44.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">私も傷ついてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便越发容易受伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi mo ki zu tsu i te ku</span></p><p begin="00:45.650" end="00:48.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">なんでいつもこうなっちゃうんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么总是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n de i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="00:48.825" end="00:50.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">間違いばかりで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">处处净是差错</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma chi ga i ba ka ri de</span></p><p begin="00:51.178" end="00:53.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">優しくなりたくても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也想要变得温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi ku na ri ta ku te mo</span></p><p begin="00:53.867" end="00:56.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">正解なんて教えてくれないじゃん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可没有人愿意告诉我正确答案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i ka i na n te o shi e te ku re na i ja n</span></p><p begin="00:57.415" end="01:00.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">なんにもうまくいかないや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终诸事不顺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ni mo u ma ku i ka na i ya</span></p><p begin="01:02.116" end="01:05.638" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">遠くで誰かの笑い声がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远处似乎传来了谁人的讥笑声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku de da re ka no wa ra i go e ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:07.149" end="01:09.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">ぜんぶ嫌いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都好讨厌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ki ra i da</span></p><p begin="01:10.093" end="01:12.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">ぜんぶ嫌いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都好讨厌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ki ra i da</span></p><p begin="01:12.896" end="01:18.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">誰もいない場所探し堪えきれず泣いて泣いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想找个空无一人的角落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo i na i ba sho sa ga shi</span></p><p begin="01:18.939" end="01:21.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">言いたいことがあったのにな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明想说的话就在嘴边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i i ta i ko to ga a 't ta no ni na</span></p><p begin="01:21.818" end="01:23.985" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">言葉に仕方がわからない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却全然不知如何开口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ni shi ka ta ga wa ka ra na i</span></p><p begin="01:23.995" end="01:27.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">こんな声は誰にも聞こえない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样下去 任何人都无法听到我的心声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ko e ha da re ni mo ki ko e na i</span></p><p begin="01:37.791" end="01:40.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">少しの勇気出せないままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终拿不出丝毫勇气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi no yu u ki da se na i ma ma de</span></p><p begin="01:40.647" end="01:43.413" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">私なんかじゃダメだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心想着我根本做不到 不断自我否认</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi na n ka ja da me da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:43.413" end="01:46.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">予測変換もう慣れたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连输入法都习惯了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so ku he n ka n mo u na re ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:46.164" end="01:48.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">変わらないでいること<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此一成不变的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra na i de i ru ko to</span></p><p begin="01:48.954" end="01:51.755" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">信号は青 早く行かなきゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">信号灯变绿了 要快点通过才行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n go u ha a o ha ya ku i ka na kya</span></p><p begin="01:51.755" end="01:54.563" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">でも踵は張り付いたまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可脚后跟却像灌了铅一般僵在原地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo ka ka to ha ha ri tsu i ta ma ma</span></p><p begin="01:54.563" end="01:57.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">揺らぐ心は言い訳探し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">动摇不定的心 一味寻找着借口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra gu ko ko ro ha i i wa ke sa ga shi</span></p><p begin="01:57.343" end="02:00.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">点滅を待っているんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">静待绿灯闪烁变红</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te n me tsu wo ma 't te i ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:00.999" end="02:03.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">なんでそんな簡単に言うの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算是再平常的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n de so n na ka n ta n ni i u no</span></p><p begin="02:04.140" end="02:06.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">普通のことだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么也能如此轻易地说出口呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu tsu u no ko to da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:06.547" end="02:09.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">比べたくないのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明不想和任何人比较</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ra be ta ku na i no ni</span></p><p begin="02:09.164" end="02:12.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">みんなが眩しく見えてしまうんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可大家看起来都无比耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na ga ma bu shi ku mi e te shi ma u n da</span></p><p begin="02:12.764" end="02:15.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">頑張ってるつもりだけで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是摆出一副竭尽全力的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ga n ba 't te ru tsu mo ri da ke de</span></p><p begin="02:17.396" end="02:20.814" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">別に「頑張れてない」んだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实“并没有怎么努力”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">be tsu ni 「 ga n ba re te na i 」 n da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:22.525" end="02:25.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">ぜんぶ嫌いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都好讨厌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ki ra i da</span></p><p begin="02:25.315" end="02:28.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">ぜんぶ嫌いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都好讨厌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ki ra i da</span></p><p begin="02:28.123" end="02:30.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">誰も知らない傷を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤身一人掩盖着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo shi ra na i ki zu wo</span></p><p begin="02:30.611" end="02:34.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">ひとりで隠して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些无人知晓的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri de ka ku shi te</span></p><p begin="02:34.285" end="02:36.804" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">悔しかったんだよホントは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我真的很懊悔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ya shi ka 't ta n da yo ho n to ha</span></p><p begin="02:36.814" end="02:39.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">諦められない 諦めない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能放弃 我不会放弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ki ra me ra re na i a ki ra me na i</span></p><p begin="02:39.313" end="02:43.004" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">こんな思いはどこにも届かない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这份心情却无法传递给任何人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na o mo i ha do ko ni mo to do ka na i</span></p><p begin="02:44.859" end="02:46.104" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">届かない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ka na i</span></p><p begin="02:47.659" end="02:48.953" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">届かない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ka na i</span></p><p begin="02:48.995" end="02:50.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">届かない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ka na i</span></p><p begin="02:50.378" end="02:51.488" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">届かない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ka na i</span></p><p begin="02:53.903" end="02:56.457" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">言葉は人を傷つける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语的利刃能够伤人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ha hi to wo ki zu tsu ke ru</span></p><p begin="02:56.687" end="02:59.113" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">取り戻すこともできない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也根本无法挽回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ri mo do su ko to mo de ki na i</span></p><p begin="02:59.520" end="03:02.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">それならって本音を隠した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心想着既然如此 那不如就掩藏起真心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re na ra 't te ho n ne wo ka ku shi ta</span></p><p begin="03:03.386" end="03:04.453" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo</span></p><p begin="03:05.083" end="03:07.792" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">言われて嬉しかったことも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">受到他人的赞扬而欢欣不已的时刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i wa re te u re shi ka 't ta ko to mo</span></p><p begin="03:07.814" end="03:10.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">忘れるわけがないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也始终难忘</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ru wa ke ga na i n da</span></p><p begin="03:10.003" end="03:19.583" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">手放したくない言葉だけを胸に抱いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅仅将那些无法割舍的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te ba na shi ta ku na i</span></p><p begin="03:25.608" end="03:28.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">夕焼け空に包まれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黄昏晚霞似火 将我包容其中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u ya ke so ra ni tsu tsu ma re ru</span></p><p begin="03:29.905" end="03:33.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">私はまた明日に呼ばれてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全新的明天仍在呼唤着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha ma ta a shi ta ni yo ba re te ru</span></p><p begin="03:35.040" end="03:37.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">ぜんぶ嫌いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都好讨厌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ki ra i da</span></p><p begin="03:37.900" end="03:40.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">ぜんぶ嫌いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都好讨厌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ki ra i da</span></p><p begin="03:40.768" end="03:46.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">誰もいない場所で今ひとり泣いて泣いて泣いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想在空无一人的角落里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo i na i ba sho de</span></p><p begin="03:46.889" end="03:49.635" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">言いたいことばっかりなのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明想说的话堆积如山</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i i ta i ko to ba 'k ka ri na no ni</span></p><p begin="03:49.642" end="03:51.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">言葉に仕方がわからない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却全然不知如何开口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ni shi ka ta ga wa ka ra na i</span></p><p begin="03:51.929" end="03:55.732" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">こんな声は誰にも聞こえない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样下去 任何人都无法听到我的心声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ko e ha da re ni mo ki ko e na i</span></p></div></body></tt>